WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.938
Your Level 4 learners need their own organiser for every

00:00:03.938 --> 00:00:07.462
lesson, and building those pages each week takes hours.

00:00:08.474 --> 00:00:11.186
62 printable A4 pages.

00:00:12.206 --> 00:00:17.377
It's for learners aged 12 to 14 (CEFR B1 to B2) following Level

00:00:17.377 --> 00:00:20.168
4 Mastery with a teacher or tutor.

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:23.620
190,000 dong per learner.

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:26.720
See the sample, or message Mr. Jay on Zalo.

